    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69676" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάκη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woolly</i> or <i>hairy skin</i>, 
